    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d897-a1">

                <pb facs="1074" n="978" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg978"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 418—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-06-06"><hi rendition="#italic">June 6,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Can arrangements be made confidentially with British company owning cable from
                    Manila to Hongkong for use of same by United States authorities?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
